{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01U9oqg1VnB5JEKT3gQtYxoy","type":"tool_result","content":"{\"result\":\"{\\\"success\\\": true, \\\"data\\\": {\\\"path\\\": \\\"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0509_1/projects/cost-verify-agent-rl/report.md\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<!-- AUTO-FACTS-BEGIN (generated 2026-05-16T19:20:34Z; do not edit — regenerated by auto_build_report_facts) -->\\\\n## 📊 当前状态（auto-derived from registry）\\\\n\\\\n**总计**: 54 个实验 — DONE 36, PENDING 1, PREPARING 17\\\\n**DONE 分布**: failed 19, killed 9, negative 5, success 3\\\\n\\\\n### GPU 占用\\\\n- **分配**: 2 张 — bjb1-17606:cuda:0, bjb1-17606:cuda:1\\\\n- **空闲（分配了没跑）**: bjb1-17606:cuda:0, bjb1-17606:cuda:1\\\\n\\\\n### 🏃 RUNNING\\\\n_（无）_\\\\n\\\\n### 📌 最近完成 (top 5)\\\\n- `exp029_episode_level` [failed] — 2026-05-16T19:20:33 — process dead 5× with no sentinel/W&B — auto-resolved as failed\\\\n- `exp028c_selfguide_recipe` [failed] — 2026-05-16T08:29:53 — process dead 5× with no sentinel/W&B — auto-resolved as failed\\\\n- `exp028a_recipe_fix` [killed] — 2026-05-15T21:25:46\\\\n- `exp028_prereq_zeroshot` [negative] — 2026-05-15T21:11:42\\\\n- `exp027_stable_grpo` [failed] — 2026-05-15T20:44:26 — EXIT_CODE=1 (generic error — check log tail)\\\\n\\\\n### 🔴 最近失败原因 (top 3)\\\\n- `exp029_episode_level`: process dead 5× with no sentinel/W&B — auto-resolved as failed\\\\n- `exp028c_selfguide_recipe`: process dead 5× with no sentinel/W&B — auto-resolved as failed\\\\n- `exp028a_recipe_fix`: _(no failure_reason — pre-2026-04-24 entry)_\\\\n\\\\n<!-- AUTO-FACTS-END -->\\\\n\\\\n---\\\\n\\\\n# Handover — 2026-05-16\\\\n\\\\n> 由 Agent 生成，每次状态变更后自动更新。硬限 150 行。\\\\n\\\\n## 运行中\\\\n（无）\\\\n\\\\n## 待处理\\\\n- exp025c（等待人工审批）\\\\n- exp028_prereq_zeroshot_instruct: Qwen3-1.7B-Instruct 零样本 ALFWorld eval，验证\\\\\\\"SFT是毒药\\\\\\\"假设。如果 Instruct ≥15% success（vs SFT checkpoint 6.25%），则确认 SFT 起点有害，exp028a 可跳过 SFT 直接 GRPO。（准备中）\\\\n- exp021_sft_ragen_format: Two-stage SFT with RAGEN-format data (v4). From exp008_sft checkpoint, fine-tune with v4 data (RAGEN Turn/State/Reward structure, fixed system prompt with consistent <answer> tag instruction). LR=5e-6, 2 epochs. Validate via RAGEN val_before_train (not eval_sft_fast). Pass: RAGEN val success >= 10%, action_is_valid >= 85%.（准备中）\\\\n- exp020d_grpo_from_sft: GRPO from exp019b SFT checkpoint (20% success baseline). Sparse reward only (won=10.0), LR=5e-7, kl_loss_coef=0.1, max_grad_norm=1.0, 30 steps. Pass: success ≥ 20%. Symlink fix for response_mask assertion (proven in exp020b). exp020c failed: Hydra key path wrong.（准备中）\\\\n- exp020c_grpo_from_sft: GRPO from exp019b SFT checkpoint (20% success baseline). Sparse reward only (won=10.0), LR=5e-7, kl_loss_coef=0.1, max_grad_norm=1.0, 30 steps. Pass: success ≥ 20%. Fix: symlink + enable_response_mask=false (exp020/020b crashed on response_mask assertion).（准备中）\\\\n- exp019c_expert_sft_v3: Two-stage Expert SFT（重试）: 从 exp008_sft checkpoint 出发，用 v3 数据（保留原始 move actions + admissible actions augmentation）微调。LR=5e-6, 2 epochs, batch=4, grad_accum=4, max_seq=4096。Pass: success ≥ 10%, format_ok ≥ 90%, action_is_valid ≥ 85%。（准备中）\\\\n- exp019b_expert_sft_v2（准备中）\\\\n- exp018_sft_grpo: Expert SFT → Sparse GRPO：从 exp017 SFT checkpoint 开始纯 sparse GRPO 训练。SFT 提升 baseline success rate（≥10%），使 GRPO 有足够非零 reward group 产生有效梯度。LR=5e-7, kl_loss_coef=0.1, max_grad_norm=1.0, won=10.0, 无 bonus/penalty, GRPO 30 步。Pass: success ≥ 20%。（准备中）\\\\n- exp014b: 极低 Dense Reward: valid_action_bonus=0.01（1:1000 比例），测试极弱 bonus 能否防 collapse 又不引发 gaming。如果 bonus 弱到不影响 GRPO reward ranking，模型不会被诱导走捷径。success_reward=10.0, format_penalty=0, 从 exp008 step 5 checkpoint 恢复, GRPO 30 步。（准备中）\\\\n- exp014a: Success-Gated Dense Reward: valid_action_bonus=0.15 只在 group 内至少一条 trajectory success 时才给。消除 reward gaming 的独立最大化路径——没有 success 就没有 bonus，模型必须探索 success。success_reward=10.0, format_penalty=0, 从 exp008 step 5 checkpoint 恢复, GRPO 30 步。（准备中）\\\\n- …另有 9 项\\\\n\\\\n## 近期结论\\\\n- **exp029_episode_level** (failed): Episode-level 训练（context_window_mode: full）解决 step_independent h=2 的信用分配缺陷，模型能学到跨步规划策略，val success 不再停滞于 baseline。 ← 基于 exp028c_selfguide_recipe\\\\n- **exp028c_selfguide_recipe** (failed): —\\\\n- **exp028a_recipe_fix** (killed): invalid_action_penalty (-0.1) 为全失败 GRPO group 提供非零方差梯度信号。从 exp021 SFT checkpoint (6.25% success) 出发，仅增加 invalid_action_penalty_coef=0.1，其余参数与 exp027 完全一致。预期：penalty 让失败 trajectory 间有区分（invalid action 多=reward更低），解决 ~43% group 零梯度问题。Pass: success ≥20%（稳定，非瞬时 peak）。 ← 基于 exp027_stable_grpo\\\\n  [exp028a_config_diff](/api/workspace-files/projects/cost-verify-agent-rl/artifacts/exp028a_recipe_fix/intermediate/exp028a_config_diff.txt)\\\\n\\\\n## 趋势\\\\n成功 3 / 负向 5 / 失败 20 / 共 37\\\\nepochs: 2 ↓（近 3 次 success）\\\\n\\\\n## 下一步\\\\n（无活跃 idea，请通过 ideas.md 添加）\\\\n\\\\n## 资源状态\\\\nbjb1-17606: 无 GPU 信息\\\\n\\\\n## 告警\\\\n- exp_001: 训练失败 — unknown\\\\n- exp_001b: 训练失败 — unknown\\\\n- exp_002: 训练失败 — unknown\\\\n- exp003: 训练失败 — unknown\\\\n- exp007: 训练失败 — unknown\\\\n- exp009: 训练失败 — unknown\\\\n- exp010: 训练失败 — unknown\\\\n- exp011: 已被终止 — unknown\\\\n- exp012: 训练失败 — unknown\\\\n- exp012b: 已被终止 — unknown\\\\n- exp013: 已被终止 — unknown\\\\n- exp013b: 训练失败 — unknown\\\\n- exp013c: 已被终止 — unknown\\\\n- exp013d: 训练失败 — unknown\\\\n- exp013e: 训练失败 — unknown\\\\n- exp015: 已被终止 — unknown\\\\n- exp016: 训练失败 — unknown\\\\n- exp019_expert_sft_v2: 已被终止 — unknown\\\\n- exp020_grpo_from_sft: 训练失败 — unknown\\\\n- exp022_grpo_from_sft_v4: 已被终止 — unknown\\\\n- exp023_grpo_parallel: 训练失败 — unknown\\\\n- exp023c_grpo_serial: 训练失败 — unknown\\\\n- exp024_success_gated_grpo: 已被终止 — unknown\\\\n- exp025: 训练失败 — unknown\\\\n- exp025b: 训练失败 — unknown\\\\n- exp027_stable_grpo: 训练失败 — unknown\\\\n- exp028a_recipe_fix: 已被终止 — unknown\\\\n- exp028c_selfguide_recipe: 训练失败 — unknown\\\\n- exp029_episode_level: 训练失败 — unknown\\\\n\\\", \\\"total_chars\\\": 5159, \\\"truncated\\\": false}, \\\"error\\\": null, \\\"metadata\\\": {}}\"}"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":