{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_01UESPaVD3vU4Ss6gF5rYdQV","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Both reviews are in. Now conducting the roundtable synthesis.\n\n**Step 2 (Cross-share):** R1 scores 4/6 (Weak Accept), acknowledging solid experimental execution on Contribution 1 but flagging B-IAVR as incremental and missing GiGPO comparison. R2 scores 3/6 (Weak Reject), arguing episode-level GRPO is functionally REINFORCE with trajectory returns (low novelty), related work is critically inadequate (10 refs), and absolute performance is far below SOTA.\n\n**Step 3 (Convergence):** Both reviewers agree on: (1) B-IAVR results are marginal, (2) related work is insufficient, (3) absolute performance well below SOTA, (4) the dramatic episode vs step-independent gap is real but the comparison target is arguably broken-by-construction. R1 is more charitable on experimental rigor; R2 is more critical on novelty. Both converge toward the 3-4 range.\n\nLet me now compile and submit the final report."}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3603,"cache_read_input_tokens":57951,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":3603},"output_tokens":8,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"10a3f31b-71c7-4a9c-9f06-cb705222db6e","uuid":"d89c1fdf-148c-4510-a542-287cd433e588"}
